From: ggbdpq <ggbdpq@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 23:16:34 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] library: Hermes's bots are profiles, so the library's servers
 go into every profile's config as well
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Hermes Agent reads mcp_servers from each bot's own config.yaml
(<root>/profiles/<name>), which reads no other home's — as magpie's own
wiring has it (agent.HermesProfiles) — but the library's target named the
main home's file alone, so `magpie library sync` gave the servers to the
default home only, and every profile's session had none (#2540). The
profile configs go into the target's Also now, written and taken out with
the main one's, as dsh's patch lists are; a profile's own settings stay
as its user set them, and only magpie's come out again.

Fixes #2540

Generated-by: GLM-5.3-Flash (ZCode)
